#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3563
msgid "Answers to frequent configuration questions and hosting best practices:"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3583
msgid "How do I embed a PDF in WordPress?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3584
msgid "Add `[flipset file=\"https://example.com/document.pdf\"]` to a post or page, insert the \"Flipset Viewer\" block and pick a PDF from the Media Library, or paste a direct `.pdf` link on its own line."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3588
msgid "Shortcode or block - which should I use?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3589
msgid "They render the same viewer. Use the block in the editor if you want a file picker and first-page preview. Use `[flipset file=\"...\"]` in the classic editor, widgets or PHP templates. Elementor, Divi and Beaver Builder have Flipset Viewer and Flipset Library widgets that use the same renderer."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3593
msgid "Can I save an embed and reuse it?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3594
msgid "Yes. Build it in Flipset → Shortcode Builder, save it, and use `[flipset id=\"1\"]` or the block's saved-embed ID. Edit the saved embed later and every page that uses it updates."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3598
msgid "How do I show a gallery of all my PDFs?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3599
msgid "Add `[flipset_library]` to a page, or insert the Flipset Library block. Visitors see a grid of Media Library PDFs and can open any document in the Flipset viewer without leaving the page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3603
msgid "Does this send my documents to a third-party server?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3604
msgid "No. Rendering happens in the visitor's browser with the PDF.js library bundled in this plugin. Share links open outside sites only when a visitor clicks them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3608
msgid "How do I resolve CORS (Cross-Origin) errors when loading remote PDFs?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3609
msgid "Browsers block scripts from reading PDFs hosted on other domains unless that remote server allows CORS. The easiest fix is uploading the PDF directly to your WordPress Media Library. If you must use a remote host, configure the header Access-Control-Allow-Origin: * on that remote server."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3613
msgid "Why are PDF.js scripts excluded from cache plugins?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3614
msgid "PDF.js requires its worker script (pdf.worker.min.js) to load in an isolated worker thread. Combining, deferring, or minifying it with other theme JS breaks web worker loading. Flipset automatically sets data-no-optimize rules for WP Rocket, LiteSpeed Cache, Autoptimize, and W3 Total Cache."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3618
msgid "How do thumbnail generation and search indexing work?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-flipset-admin.php:3619
msgid "The first time an admin visits the Documents Library tab, the browser renders page 1 of each PDF and saves a high-quality cover thumbnail in your Media Library, while simultaneously extracting text so visitors can search for PDF contents using WordPress site search."
msgstr ""

